<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Westpac prices BOS Intl fungible bond.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Westpac prices BOS Intl fungible bond.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>BOS International's A$50 million November 2001 fungible bond, announced on Wednesday, has been priced to yield 7.185 percent, lead manager Westpac Bank Group said.</p>
</text>
